abstract: >-
  Metapython is a comprehensive, production-ready meta-analysis platform
  that combines advanced statistical methods with modern software engineering
  practices. It provides researchers with tools for conducting rigorous
  meta-analyses, from basic fixed and random effects models to advanced
  Bayesian hierarchical models and network meta-analysis. The platform
  emphasizes reproducibility, extensibility through a plugin system, and
  integration with modern data infrastructure. Metapython supports the
  complete meta-analysis workflow including data import, effect size
  calculation, heterogeneity assessment, publication bias detection,
  sensitivity analysis, and comprehensive reporting.
